---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Privacy Policy | Quit Smoking Hub',
  description:
    'Privacy policy for Quit Smoking Hub: what data we process, how community content is de-identified, and what we do not publish.',
  ignoreTitleTemplate: true,
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 pt-8 md:pt-12 pb-4">
    <p class="text-base font-bold tracking-wide uppercase text-secondary mb-2 text-center">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-tighter tracking-tighter font-heading text-heading text-center">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-lg text-muted text-center">
      <em>Last updated: October 2026</em>
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 space-y-8">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading mb-3">In short</h2>
      <p class="text-muted dark:text-slate-400">
        Quit Smoking Hub is a static informational website. We do not require accounts, do not collect personal
        information through forms, and do not sell or share data with third parties.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading mb-3">Community content and de-identification</h2>
      <p class="text-muted dark:text-slate-400">
        Community experiences published on this site are editorial syntheses of public forum material. We never
        publish usernames, avatars, user IDs, contact details, real names or any other identifying information.
        Source material is used for research and structuring only, never reproduced verbatim.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading mb-3">Technical data</h2>
      <p class="text-muted dark:text-slate-400">
        As a static site we process only the standard technical data any website receives (such as IP addresses in
        server logs, where logs are enabled by the hosting provider). We do not use tracking cookies or advertising
        networks.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading mb-3">Third-party links</h2>
      <p class="text-muted dark:text-slate-400">
        Pages link to external resources (research articles, public health agencies, quitlines). We are not
        responsible for the privacy practices of those sites.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading mb-3">Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-muted dark:text-slate-400">
        For privacy questions, contact the site operator through the details on the hosting platform.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
